<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="Architecture" id="job-arch"><mxGraphModel dx="1900" dy="1200" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1200" background="#ffffff"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
<mxCell id="t" value="JOB SCHEDULER - Architecture (Redis ZPOPMIN + Leader-Elected Scheduler + Monitor Heartbeat)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a237e" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="20" width="1740" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="clientLayer" value="CLIENT LAYER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="1820" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="clients" value="Users | DevOps Tools | Backend Services&#10;POST /jobs (create) | GET /jobs/{id} (status) | POST /jobs/{id}/trigger (run now) | POST /jobs/{id}/cancel" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#bbdefb;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="110" width="900" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="edgeLayer" value="EDGE LAYER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3e0;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="200" width="1820" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="gateway" value="API GATEWAY + LOAD BALANCER&#10;JWT auth | Rate limit (100 req/min per user) | Routing | Idempotency key dedup" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffcc80;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="230" width="900" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="serviceLayer" value="SERVICE LAYER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="310" width="1820" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="apiSvc" value="API Service&#10;&#10;CRUD jobs&#10;Trigger immediate&#10;View history&#10;Cancel/pause" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="360" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="schedulerSvc" value="Scheduler Service&#10;(Leader-Elected)&#10;&#10;Every 30s:&#10;  SELECT jobs WHERE&#10;  next_run &lt; now+60s&#10;  ZADD to Redis" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffcc80;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="310" y="360" width="220" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="monitorSvc" value="Monitor Service&#10;&#10;Every 30s:&#10;  Find RUNNING jobs&#10;  Check heartbeat&#10;  If expired (90s)&#10;    mark FAILED&#10;    re-enqueue" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="360" width="200" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="searchSvc" value="Search Service&#10;&#10;Query jobs&#10;Filter by status&#10;Pagination&#10;Execution logs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="360" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="workerLayer" value="WORKER POOL LAYER (Stateless, Horizontally Scalable)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="510" width="1820" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="workers" value="Worker Pool (N pods: 10-100+)&#10;&#10;Loop forever:&#10;  1. ZPOPMIN job_queue → get jobId (atomic, only one worker gets it)&#10;  2. Read job definition from Cassandra (payload, timeout, max_retries)&#10;  3. INSERT execution row: status=RUNNING, started_at=now()&#10;  4. SET job_heartbeat:{jobId} workerId EX 90&#10;  5. Execute job logic (call external API, run script, generate report)&#10;  6. Renew heartbeat every 30s: SETEX job_heartbeat:{jobId} workerId EX 90&#10;  7. On success: UPDATE execution status=SUCCESS, finished_at=now(). If CRON: compute next_run, UPDATE jobs.next_run_at&#10;  8. On failure: retry_count++. If retry_count &lt; max_retries: ZADD job_queue (score=now+backoff). Else: status=DEAD_LETTER, alert ops" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="560" width="1760" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="dataLayer" value="DATA + INFRASTRUCTURE LAYER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="670" width="1820" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="redis" value="Redis&#10;&#10;job_queue (ZSET)&#10;score=next_run_ts&#10;ZPOPMIN atomic&#10;&#10;heartbeat keys&#10;job_heartbeat:{id}&#10;EX 90 TTL&#10;&#10;scheduler_leader&#10;EX 30 TTL" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="720" width="220" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cassandra" value="Cassandra&#10;&#10;jobs table&#10;PK: job_id&#10;next_run_at (index)&#10;&#10;job_executions&#10;PK: (job_id, exec_id)&#10;CK: exec_id DESC&#10;TTL: 90 days" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="720" width="220" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s3" value="S3&#10;&#10;Large payloads&#10;(&gt; 64KB)&#10;Execution logs&#10;Job outputs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffebee;strokeColor=#c62828;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="720" width="200" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="e1" value="CRUD" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="apiSvc" target="cassandra"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e2" value="ZADD" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="schedulerSvc" target="redis"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e3" value="Read jobs" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="schedulerSvc" target="cassandra"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e4" value="ZPOPMIN" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="workers" target="redis"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e5" value="Read/Write" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="workers" target="cassandra"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e6" value="Check heartbeat" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#f57f17;dashed=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="monitorSvc" target="redis"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e7" value="Scan stuck" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;dashed=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="monitorSvc" target="cassandra"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="why" value="WHY THESE CHOICES&#10;&#10;Redis ZPOPMIN atomic queue eliminates job theft race condition: Sorted set score = next_run_unix_timestamp. ZPOPMIN atomically removes and returns the member with lowest score. Two workers calling ZPOPMIN simultaneously each get a different job — Redis guarantees this. Alternative: database polling (SELECT * WHERE status=SCHEDULED LIMIT 1 FOR UPDATE) has lock contention at 10K jobs/sec and doesn't scale.&#10;&#10;Leader-elected Scheduler prevents duplicate enqueue: Only the leader Scheduler instance is allowed to ZADD jobs to Redis. Leader holds Redis key scheduler_leader with 30s TTL, renews every 15s. If leader dies, TTL expires, next instance wins via SETNX. Without leader election, all 10 Scheduler instances would ZADD the same job → 10 duplicates in queue → same job executes 10 times. Trade-off: single-point-of-failure temporarily (max 30s outage window during failover).&#10;&#10;Heartbeat-based stuck job detection: Worker writes SET job_heartbeat:{jobId} workerId EX 90 every 30 seconds. If worker crashes mid-job, heartbeat stops renewing → TTL expires → Monitor sees RUNNING job with missing heartbeat → marks FAILED → re-enqueues with new execution_id. Alternative: timeout-only approach (mark job FAILED after timeout_seconds) misses jobs stuck in infinite loops that never finish but never crash either.&#10;&#10;At-least-once execution semantics: Worker crash during execution → Monitor re-enqueues → job may run twice (original worker + new worker). Solution: jobs must be idempotent (check 'did I already process order 42?' before acting). Alternative: exactly-once requires distributed transactions (Redis lock + DB write in 2PC) — huge complexity, fragile under network partitions. At-least-once is the pragmatic engineering choice for 99% of batch jobs.&#10;&#10;Cassandra time-series partitioning for execution history: Partition key = job_id, clustering key = execution_id (TIMEUUID, descending). Query: SELECT * FROM job_executions WHERE job_id=X ORDER BY execution_id DESC LIMIT 20 → single-partition read, fast. All executions for one job co-located on same node. TTL = 90 days auto-expires old executions without manual cleanup. Alternative: MySQL with auto-increment ID requires DELETE cron job and has no natural time ordering.&#10;&#10;Thundering herd prevention with deterministic jitter: 10,000 jobs all scheduled for midnight (cron '0 0 * * *') → all workers busy at once → Redis queue spike → downstream service overload. Solution: next_run = cron_computed_time + (hash(job_id) % 300). Spreads jobs over 5 minutes. Jitter is deterministic per job_id (same job always same offset) to avoid non-deterministic execution time drift over weeks.&#10;&#10;Exponential backoff retry prevents retry storm: Failed job retry delays: 1s, 2s, 4s, 8s, 16s. If downstream service is down, constant retries hammer it while it's trying to recover. Exponential backoff gives the service breathing room. After max_retries (default 3) → DEAD_LETTER state → alert human → no more automatic retries." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="900" width="1800" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
